// The truth of the fair set (S59) for Hans Sommer, Der Bote Op.9-1: written from the Litolff print
// (Collection Litolff No.1584, IMSLP #777922, data/fair/sommer9-1/litolff), bar by bar. Never to debug the reader on.
// As the print has them: bar 33's right hand adds up to five eighths (the tied chord is a dotted quarter, no rest
// after it; a spacer fills the bar); bar 34's right hand is empty (no rest printed, a spacer); bar 4's d' is one head
// shared by the beamed eighths and the dotted chord under them (both voices carry it).
title "Der Bote."
tempo "Volksthümlich, innig."
octave absolute
paper { breaksOnly }
time 3/4
key f major

part voice_ { clef treble }
part rh { clef treble }
part lh { clef bass }

